abstract: >-
  Public reproducibility artifact for the PhD dissertation
  "Data-Driven Cybersecurity for Connected Devices: Traffic, Provenance,
  and Behavioral Threat Detection" (Texas Tech University, December 2026).
  Contains the code, data preparation scripts, and configurations for
  Chapters 2 through 5, so that each comparison in the dissertation can
  be rerun.
